    "en": {
      "trackName": "Watch Chess",
      "description": "Watch Chess is built for following the world's top chess tournaments live. Keep up with every game and know when the position turns critical—even from your Lock Screen.\n\nFOLLOW TOURNAMENTS LIVE\n\n• Browse live and recent top-level tournaments.\n• Move through every game with a simple swipe.\n• Follow several boards at once.\n• Check pairings, standings, results, and real-time clocks.\n\nNEVER MISS THE MOMENT\n\n• Choose alerts for round starts and game results.\n• Get highlighted-moment alerts for blunders, brilliant moves, forced mates, time pressure, and hard-to-find moves.\n\nLIVE ACTIVITIES\n\nFollow a live game from the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island, with the board, last move, and clocks updating as the action unfolds.\n\nSTOCKFISH 18 GAME REPORTS\n\nReview a completed game with Stockfish 18. See accuracy and move quality, find critical turning points, and understand where the game changed.\n\nAPPLE WATCH\n\nFollow tournaments and games from your wrist with a dedicated Apple Watch experience.\n\nHave questions or feedback? Email info@watchchessapp.com or find us at @watch_chess.\n\nSubscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel your subscription in your App Store account settings. Any unused portion of a free trial is forfeited when you purchase a subscription. Terms of Service: https://watchchess.app/tos.html. Privacy Policy: https://watchchess.app/privacy.html.",
      "releaseNotes": "• Get alerts when top games reach critical moments, including blunders, brilliant moves, forced mates, time pressure, and hard-to-find moves.\n• Improved tournament schedules and player cards.\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/watch-chess/id980989211?uo=4",
